Note: EPL HTTP Package — Basic Usage Examples
Import "epl-http"

Say "=== EPL HTTP Package Demo ==="

Note: Simple GET request
Say "Fetching data from API..."
response = http_get("https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1")
status = response_status(response)
Say "Status: " + status

If response_is_ok(response) then
    data = response_json(response)
    Say "Post fetched successfully!"
End

Note: GET with Bearer token
Say ""
Say "Authenticated request..."
Set response to http_with_bearer_token("https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/2", "demo-token")
Say "Auth request status: " + response_status(response)

Note: Build URL with parameters
search_url = build_url("https://api.example.com", "/search", Map)
Say ""
Say "Built URL: " + search_url

Note: URL encoding
encoded = encode_url("hello world & more")
Say "Encoded: " + encoded
decoded = decode_url(encoded)
Say "Decoded: " + decoded

Say ""
Say "=== Done! ==="
